    "title": "Seymour Duncan: 2 humbuckers, 3-way toggle, 2 volumes, 1 tone",
    "creator": "Pickup Lab; reference: Seymour Duncan",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.seymourduncan.com/images/wiring-diagrams/2H_3G_2V_1T.pdf",
    "permission": "Seymour Duncan encourages sharing these wiring diagrams freely; commercial use requires prior written permission. LIMITATIONS: Two blade poles represent the 3-way toggle, not its physical terminals. Generic series humbuckers omit lead colors, polarity, values, bridge ground, cable, and load. Red/white joins are coil links; no bridge terminal exists. Pots use logical lugs and a linear scale, not audio taper. Two volumes make the analyzer estimate unavailable."
  },
